summary:
To install Bun v1.0.19:
bash
curl https://bun.sh/install | bash
or you can use npm
npm install -g bun
To upgrade to Bun v1.0.19:
bash
bun upgrade
Read Bun v1.0.19's release notes on Bun's blog
